WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Qo‘llanma 2/4. Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:07.320
1. BugunBor ilovasini oching. Ro‘yxatdan o‘tish uchun pastdagi «Profil» bo‘limiga o‘ting.

3
00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:11.040
2. «Telegram orqali kirish» tugmasini bosing — parol va SMS kerak emas.

4
00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.064
3. Maxfiylik siyosati va foydalanish shartlariga rozilik belgisini qo‘ying.

5
00:00:14.064 --> 00:00:16.483
4. Endi «Telegram orqali kirish»ni bosing.

6
00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:19.683
5. Ilova moslik kodini ko‘rsatadi va Telegram’ni ochadi. Kodni eslab qoling.

7
00:00:19.683 --> 00:00:22.883
6. Telegram’da BugunBor boti ochiladi. Pastdagi «Start» tugmasini bosing.

8
00:00:22.883 --> 00:00:27.083
7. Bot xuddi shu kodni ko‘rsatadi. Kod bir xil bo‘lsa, «📱 Raqamni yuborish»ni bosing.

9
00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:30.083
8. Tasdiqlandi! Endi BugunBor ilovasiga qayting.

10
00:00:30.083 --> 00:00:33.692
Ilova kirishni o‘zi yakunlaydi.

11
00:00:33.692 --> 00:00:36.692
9. Tayyor! Profilingizda ismingiz va tejagan pulingiz ko‘rinadi.

12
00:00:36.692 --> 00:00:39.892
Tayyor! Keyingi: biznesni qo‘shish.
